        "collapsible_item_KyWRFG": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Aerospace Industry",
            "content": "<p>Aerospace applications require adhesive tapes that can perform under harsh operating conditions. Components may be exposed to extreme temperatures, moisture, pressure changes, vibration, and UV radiation.</p><p>Because of these demands, aerospace tapes must meet strict standards for adhesion, flammability, weight, durability, and temperature resistance. NADCO supports aerospace applications with custom tape solutions built for challenging environments.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": true,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_L7e7G6": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Automotive Industry",
            "content": "<p>Automotive manufacturers and suppliers rely on tapes and labels for assembly, masking, mounting, identification, insulation, and protective applications. These products must perform consistently through production, handling, and vehicle use.</p><p>With a 35,000 square foot facility and advanced manufacturing technology, NADCO creates standard and custom tapes and pressure-sensitive labels for automotive applications. Our capabilities support projects that require precision, durability, and application-specific design.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_tDnfmV": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Contruction Industry",
            "content": "<p>Job sites use adhesive tapes for many interior and exterior applications. These may include surface protection, masking, sealing, hazard marking, temporary signage, and material identification.</p><p>Construction tapes must often withstand rough handling, dust, moisture, temperature changes, and exposure to outdoor conditions. NADCO provides tape solutions designed to support organization, safety, and performance on active construction sites.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_kchJyT": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Electronics Industry",
            "content": "<p>Electronics applications often require adhesive tapes for insulation, shielding, masking, mounting, and component protection. Each use may require specific material, adhesive, thickness, and performance properties.</p><p>NADCO offers a wide range of material and adhesive options for electronic products and applications. Our experience in this industry allows us to create custom tape solutions that support performance, protection, and manufacturing requirements.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_MAXRyn": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Medical Industry",
            "content": "<p>Medical adhesive tapes must meet strict standards for safety, cleanliness, performance, and reliability. Depending on the application, tapes may need to be biocompatible, flexible, durable, and able to perform under challenging conditions.</p><p>Customization is often needed for medical tape applications because product requirements can vary widely. NADCO works with medical industry clients to develop adhesive solutions that match specific use cases and performance needs.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_kEKmwq": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Nuclear Industry",
            "content": "<p>Nuclear environments require tapes and labels that support safety, visibility, and hazard communication. Applications may include nuclear warning labels, RAD wipes, hazard tape, radioactivity indicator signage, and other safety-related products.</p><p>NADCO provides nuclear tape and label designs with a range of features and customization options. Our goal is to support safer operations with adhesive solutions created for each application’s unique requirements.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_UYQyeX": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Personal Protective Equipment Industry",
            "content": "<p>PPE helps reduce exposure to workplace hazards, germs, impact risks, and dangerous conditions. Many industries rely on protective equipment such as face protection, eye protection, gloves, masks, and hard hats.</p><p>Adhesive tapes and labels can support PPE manufacturing, identification, assembly, and safety communication. NADCO helps create custom adhesive products for PPE applications across different industries and working environments.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_xGQaQG": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Safety Industry",
            "content": "<p>Every workplace needs clear communication to help reduce risk and guide safe movement. Safety tapes can mark hazards, direct traffic, separate work zones, identify restricted areas, and support compliance programs.</p><p>NADCO provides safety tape solutions designed for visibility, durability, and clear messaging. With custom colors, patterns, sizes, and printing options, our tapes can help facilities create safer and more organized environments.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
